features
    Experiment
        mandatory
            Language
                alternative
                    LangC
                    LangPython
            NumType
                alternative
                    Float32
                    Float64
            Generator
                alternative
                    GenRandC
                    GenPyNative
                    GenPyCStyle
            Interval
                alternative
                    Int_0_1
                    Int_0_1000
                    Int_m1_1
                    Int_m1000_1000
                    Int_m1e15_1e15
            Repetitions
                alternative
                    Rep100
                    Rep1000
                    Rep100000
                    Rep1000000
                    Rep10000000
            Seed
                alternative
                    Seed1
                    Seed2
                    Seed3
                    Seed42
                    SeedNotFixed
            Property
                alternative
                    AssocAdd
                    AssocMul
                    Distrib
                    Inverse
